                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Disclaimer: I accuired this game as a result of the Kolenka Games '17 Bundle, so I (technically) did not pay full price for it. \n\nAn interesting take on shooting and action, but not worth the $3 they're asking for it. At roughly a half hour in legnth, it is too short, even for that price, and any ideas it brings to the table are not explored very well. \n\nThe dialogue is delightfully incoherent, however, and is almost worth playing the game through on its own. It isn't bad, I just can't reccomend it.",
